WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
We have an interesting
day here in Los Angeles.

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.920
It's cold and raining,
and that never happens.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.753
I know.

00:00:04.753 --> 00:00:06.790
And you were out in the courtyard,

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.950
there's a little courtyard
here at the theater,

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.750
and you had to come in, you were so cold.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.600
I got chilly.
Yeah.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.120
I got chilly, and I don't get chilly.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.710
So yeah, no, it's fun.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.040
I love it when it's like this.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.310
I love it like this, and I also love

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:22.940
that everybody in Los Angeles overreacts.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:25.770
If the temperature hits 62,

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:30.210
people act as if there's a
meteor headed towards earth

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:32.160
and we're all going to die within seconds.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:35.130
They scream, they run, they
crash their cars into walls.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:39.780
They put on their big down
parkas, 'cause it's 58.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:43.360
Yeah, everyone here looks
like a Nordic explorer.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:47.480
Anywho, tough guys like
me that grew up in Boston,

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.510
we don't worry about this weather.

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:52.440
And tough guys do this all the time.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.653
This is just what a tough guy does.

